---

<header class="editorial-header">
  <div class="meta-top">
    <span>Registro de Software &bull; 2026</span>
    <span>Puerto Montt, Chile &bull; 41°28′ S</span>
  </div>

  <div class="title-block">
    <h1>Felipe Godoy Pérez</h1>
    <p class="role-title">Desarrollo Web, Backend &amp; Sistemas Embebidos</p>
  </div>

  <p class="intro-text">
    Desarrollo aplicaciones web con Django y Astro, plataformas de comercio electrónico y módulos de mapas en tiempo real. También experimento con hardware y microcontroladores (ESP32, RP2040) para captura de datos y monitoreo en terreno en el sur de Chile.
  </p>

  <div class="quick-links">
    <button class="link-btn copy-btn" data-copy-email="felipegp90@gmail.com" type="button" title="Copiar correo">
      <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg>
      <span>felipegp90@gmail.com</span>
      <span class="copy-tag">Copiar</span>
    </button>

    <a href="https://github.com/felipooon" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="link-btn">
      <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
      <span>github.com/felipooon</span>
      <span class="ext-arrow">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .editorial-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--text);
  }

  .meta-top {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .title-block {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: 2.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .role-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .intro-text {
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    max-width: 800px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .quick-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .link-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .link-btn:hover {
    background: var(--surface-matte);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .copy-btn {
    border-color: var(--border-dark);
  }

  .copy-tag {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.05rem 0.35rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ext-arrow {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    h1 { font-size: 1.85rem; }
    .meta-top { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.25rem; }
    .quick-links { flex-direction: column; }
    .link-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: space-between; }
  }
</style>
